      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hola, joven. Dime, ¿conoces a un Pokémon\nllamado Budew?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C0061002C0020006A006F00760065006E002E002000440069006D0065002C002000BF0063006F006E006F0063006500730020006100200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A006C006C0061006D00610064006F002000420075006400650077003F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪¡Bu, bu, bu!♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00A100420075002C002000620075002C0020006200750021266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Budew aguantan las épocas más frías hasta\nque su brote se abre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F007300200042007500640065007700200061006700750061006E00740061006E0020006C00610073002000E90070006F0063006100730020006D00E1007300200066007200ED00610073002000680061007300740061000A007100750065002000730075002000620072006F0074006500200073006500200061006200720065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veo en ti las cualidades necesarias para\nhacer florecer a Budew.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Te gustaría participar en nuestro concurso?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si es así, te espero delante de la fuente que hay\nen la plaza del sector 8 del Distrito Azul.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo más importante en un Budew es que esté\nbien lozano.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0020006D00E1007300200069006D0070006F007200740061006E0074006500200065006E00200075006E0020004200750064006500770020006500730020007100750065002000650073007400E9000A006200690065006E0020006C006F007A0061006E006F002E00100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A mí, en los Budew, me interesan las cualidades\nartísticas de su movimiento y su expresión facial.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te estábamos esperando.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065002000650073007400E100620061006D006F00730020006500730070006500720061006E0064006F002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero veo que no tienes ningún Budew en\ntu equipo. Es indispensable que lleves uno.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... Veo que traes un Budew contigo,\ncomo debe ser.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E002000560065006F002000710075006500200074007200610065007300200075006E00200042007500640065007700200063006F006E007400690067006F002C000A0063006F006D006F002000640065006200650020007300650072002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te llamas <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSiempre me ha parecido un nombre de persona\nmadura y con los pies en la tierra.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las tasas de admisión para registrarse en\nel concurso son de 5800 <U+E300>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610073002000740061007300610073002000640065002000610064006D00690073006900F3006E0020007000610072006100200072006500670069007300740072006100720073006500200065006E000A0065006C00200063006F006E0063007500720073006F00200073006F006E00200064006500200035003800300030202FE300002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Poco me parece!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0063006F0020006D0065002000700061007200650063006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, pero... ¿hay que pagar?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020007000650072006F002E002E002E002000BF0068006100790020007100750065002000700061006700610072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ten un poco de fe! ¡Tu Budew y tú seguro que\nlo bordáis!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065006E00200075006E00200070006F0063006F0020006400650020006600650021002000A100540075002000420075006400650077002000790020007400FA002000730065006700750072006F0020007100750065000A006C006F00200062006F0072006400E100690073002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que no tienes suficiente dinero.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300720065006F00200071007500650020006E006F0020007400690065006E0065007300200073007500660069006300690065006E00740065002000640069006E00650072006F002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy deseando que empiece el concurso.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F0079002000640065007300650061006E0064006F002000710075006500200065006D0070006900650063006500200065006C00200063006F006E0063007500720073006F002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para participar en el concurso, necesitas a\nun Budew en tu equipo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200610020007000610072007400690063006900700061007200200065006E00200065006C00200063006F006E0063007500720073006F002C0020006E0065006300650073006900740061007300200061000A0075006E00200042007500640065007700200065006E002000740075002000650071007500690070006F002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El primer aspirante es el Budew de Florèle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020007000720069006D006500720020006100730070006900720061006E0074006500200065007300200065006C00200042007500640065007700200064006500200046006C006F007200E8006C0065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bud, bud...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750064002C0020006200750064002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay que ver! ¡Qué brote tan lustroso!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004800610079002000710075006500200076006500720021002000A10051007500E9002000620072006F00740065002000740061006E0020006C0075007300740072006F0073006F002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La manera de moverse es bastante común, ¿no?\nNada extraordinario en mi opinión.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por el grito se nota que está bastante nervioso.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007200200065006C00200067007200690074006F0020007300650020006E006F007400610020007100750065002000650073007400E1002000620061007300740061006E007400650020006E0065007200760069006F0073006F002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El siguiente aspirante es el Budew de Lucio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020007300690067007500690065006E007400650020006100730070006900720061006E0074006500200065007300200065006C0020004200750064006500770020006400650020004C007500630069006F002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Budeee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100420075006400650065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sabe mantener una postura digna y desprende\nun aire de fortaleza.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006200650020006D0061006E00740065006E0065007200200075006E006100200070006F007300740075007200610020006400690067006E0061002000790020006400650073007000720065006E00640065000A0075006E0020006100690072006500200064006500200066006F007200740061006C0065007A0061002E00100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Su grito no está nada mal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500200067007200690074006F0020006E006F002000650073007400E10020006E0061006400610020006D0061006C002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sin embargo, está un poco pálido de cara.\nQuizá no le ha dado mucho el sol.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El tercer aspirante es el Budew de Leire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200074006500720063006500720020006100730070006900720061006E0074006500200065007300200065006C0020004200750064006500770020006400650020004C0065006900720065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bu, bu!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100420075002C00200062007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El tamaño es imponente y salta a la vista que\nproduce mucho polen.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C002000740061006D006100F1006F00200065007300200069006D0070006F006E0065006E0074006500200079002000730061006C00740061002000610020006C00610020007600690073007400610020007100750065000A00700072006F00640075006300650020006D007500630068006F00200070006F006C0065006E002E00100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y la soltura con que se mueve es admirable.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006C006100200073006F006C007400750072006100200063006F006E00200071007500650020007300650020006D0075006500760065002000650073002000610064006D0069007200610062006C0065002E00100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero se le nota cierta frustración en la voz.\nParece un poco estresado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>El cuarto y último aspirante es el Budew\nde <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000045006C002000630075006100720074006F00200079002000FA006C00740069006D006F0020006100730070006900720061006E0074006500200065007300200065006C002000420075006400650077000A0064006500200010000201000000002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡Budew!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A100420075006400650077002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oh!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F0068002100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué maravilla!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E90020006D00610072006100760069006C006C0061002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mirad el color tan llamativo del brote!\n¡Y es tan firme y rebosante de frescura!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiene una gracia delicada al mecerse y un aspecto\nque resultan muy agradables.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y no destaca solo por su imagen...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006E006F0020006400650073007400610063006100200073006F006C006F00200070006F007200200073007500200069006D006100670065006E002E002E002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un resultado tan excepcional solo se consigue\ncuando el Pokémon confía plenamente en<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsu Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡He visto montones de Budew, pero nunca uno\ncomo este!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006500200076006900730074006F0020006D006F006E0074006F006E00650073002000640065002000420075006400650077002C0020007000650072006F0020006E0075006E0063006100200075006E006F000A0063006F006D006F00200065007300740065002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Presidente! ¡Este Budew es...!\n¡Ay, no tengo palabras!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050007200650073006900640065006E007400650021002000A10045007300740065002000420075006400650077002000650073002E002E002E0021000A00A100410079002C0020006E006F002000740065006E0067006F002000700061006C00610062007200610073002100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, parece que el veredicto es unánime.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5504,
