      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200610020006300720065006300650072002000730061006E006F0020006800610079002000710075006500200064006F0072006D006900720020006200690065006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
